    <briefdescription>
<para>AND(...) - Logical AND operation (Excel-compatible). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true if ALL arguments are true or truthy. For arrays: returns true if ALL elements are truthy.</para>
<para>Truthy values: true, non-zero numbers, non-empty strings, non-empty arrays/objects Falsy values: false, 0, &quot;&quot;, null, [], {}</para>
<para>Examples: AND(true, true, true) =&gt; true AND(true, false, true) =&gt; false AND([true, true, true]) =&gt; true (array form) AND(1, 2, 3) =&gt; true (all non-zero) AND(1, 0, 3) =&gt; false (zero is falsy) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
